Q_{C_gv}=C_gQ_vC_g,\quad
W_{C_gv}=en\,UW_vU^\dagger .
\tag{PG.57}
$$

Indeed $v_T$ gains $en$, $v_S$ gains $e$, $R_v$ is unchanged, and
$\Theta(C_g ZC_g)=U\Theta(Z)U^\dagger$ with
